# Client release approval

**Never build, publish, or OTA-deploy the Remote Keyboard client without the user
explicitly asking in that conversation.**

## Forbidden without an explicit request

- `scripts/build-android.ps1` in release mode
- `flutter build` in release mode
- Any version bump
- OTA upload or AmL One deploy

## Allowed at any time

- Debug builds and `flutter run`
- Analyzer and tests
